 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "1992-07-31",
   "text": "Health Choices Freedom Act of 1992 - Amends the Federal Food, Drug, and Cosmetic Act to define \"dietary supplement.\" Declares that a supplement is not: (1) a drug solely because of its potency or because its labeling or advertising contains certain material; or (2) a food additive if certain requirements are met. Regulates supplement labeling and advertising."
  }
 ],
